{"sourceUrl":"https://som.hit.edu.cn/info/1011/23650.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:20.595512+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://som.hit.edu.cn/info/1011/23650.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>一、申请资格</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）本次夏令营主要招募能够在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生（简称推免生）资格，拟申请到我校攻读研究生（含直博生）的202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生，前</span><span>3学年或前5学期综合成绩排名在本专业前15%，且达到所在高校推荐免试生要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）学科专业排名前10%的推免生优先考虑。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）有志于从事经管类科学研究，并具有较强研究能力的理工科推免生优先考虑。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5）英语水平良好。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请流程</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1、申请形式：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>登录哈尔滨工业大学研究生招生网官方网站夏令营报名系统（</span><span>http://hityzb.hit.edu.cn/zhxy-yjs-zs_v2/common/login?redirectUrl=/pc/xly/index），直接报名。报名时间：202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>5月</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日至</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2、申请材料：　</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）网上报名，并提供所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章成绩排名证明原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）体现英语水平的证明材料（国家英语四六级，TOEFL成绩，GRE成绩等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）其他证明材料，包括：已发表论文中代表性论文1篇，应提供全文，其他已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页扫描件；本科期间各类获奖证书扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>注：请申请人将以上材料扫描后整合为一个</span><span>PDF文件，邮件主题和文件命名为“姓名+报考学科方向”，</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日前上传至报名系统并</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>发送至邮箱</span><span>smyjs@hit.edu.cn。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>3、确定名单：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院根据申请者的网上报名信息，重点考察申请者学业水平、科研能力和综合素质，确定入营者名单。入营者名单将于</span></span><span><span>报名结束</span><span>10日内</span></span><span><span>通过夏令营报名系统或邮件的形式通知。届时未入选者，不另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请通过审核的同学务必于</span></span><span><span>收到通知</span><span>3日内</span></span><span><span>在报名端口确认参加，逾期不确认者将不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>入选者请准备以下材料进行资格复审：个人有效身份证件</span><span>,申请材料的1-3（原件），以上材料原件在入营报到时审核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、活动安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1、报到时间：拟于7月份报到</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>具体以通知为准</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、报到地点：另行通知</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3、活动内容：（1）开营式，介绍学校与学院基本情况；（2）专家学术报告；（3）师生交流会；（4）</span></span><span><span>其他活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、其他说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1、</span></span><span><span>学院将为所有营员提供夏令营期间在哈尔滨的食宿、参观等费用</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2、学员报到后需全程参加夏令营活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>、具体日程将根据实际情况进行调整。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>、具体政策以当年学校相关文件为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span><span>、其它有关信息请关注哈尔滨工业大学经济与管理学院</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span>http://som.hit.edu.cn/index.htm</span><span><span>）</span></span> <span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span>    <span>联系人：白老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span>    联系电话：</span><span>0451-86414016</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://som.hit.edu.cn/__local/C/62/46/83EB7E1A03DD685D0C1E3FB5917_D3D57B65_3B5C.png\"/></p>\n<p><span>哈尔滨工业大学经济与管理学院</span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>5月9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"4bb1686348e2f7cb9669fc5b21830d2af770f362842cc51131507e7da79a8430","textLength":1117,"sourceSha256":"4435c0fae810a6006a3444c54b219afec5bd84857b5465c467c6a06052751a04","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-41c6210402189185964e","title":"2025年哈尔滨工业大学经济与管理学院暑期夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:20.595512+00:00"}
